enus: lay down the four user-fixed pronunciations

The zip carries address/open/produce/visual with corrected phones.
dict.py build laid them down: new constant-blob records plus the four
rule arms repointed at them. dict.py read its own work back word for
word. Applied at build time so CI builds the same tree.
